  DisplayName: Mantis Scion
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Prerequisite Region - High Seas At least one of your parents is a
    member of the notorious Red Mantis assassins, merciless killers for hire who
    rarely fail to claim their marks. Whether on purpose or by simple exposure, you
    were trained from a young age in the art of stalking and killing people. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Stealth skill and the Assassin Lore skill.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance] skill feat with
    Stealth.
